menu "Swarm display"

    config SWARM_DISPLAY
        bool "Onboard OLED status screen"
        default y
        help
            Shows the node's state on the 128x64 OLED (SSD1306 on the
            classic T-Beam, SH1106 on the S3 Supreme): role, node id, band
            profile, GPS, TX/RX counters, sensors and supply voltage, redrawn
            once a second from a Core 1 task below the sensor tasks.
            On by default for bench builds. A field build turns it off
            (about 10 mA when lit; proposal 3.5 keeps the OLED dark in the
            field): with it off no display code is linked.

endmenu
